# Phase 5 lifecycle: Ctrl-Z after a finished turn. The pane runs fx with no
# job-control shell, so its process group is orphaned and SIGTSTP does not
# stop it [unverified until captured]: the wire shows the suspend restore
# (with the OSC 7501 clear) and what fx writes when it carries on.
env FX_AUTO_UPGRADE=0
gateway p5-lifecycle-one-turn.json
wait 4
type first question
key Enter
wait 3
wire w00-done
key C-z
wait 2
wire w01-after-ctrlz
snap z01-after-ctrlz
type second question
key Enter
wait 3
wire w02-next-turn
snap z02-next-turn
